# Forest Picker: a bat. It hovers with its wings spread, ready to snatch passes out of the air.
# The wings are two voxels deep so they still read from the game's steep camera.
size 9 9 3
voxel 0.1
mirror x
colors
  P purple
  l purpleLight
  d purpleDark
  w white
slice 0
  ...d.
  ...dd
  ...wd
  ....w
  ...dd
  ....d
  .....
  .....
  .....
slice 1
  ...d.
  P..dd
  PP.dd
  PPPdd
  lPPdd
  P.Pdd
  ....d
  .....
  .....
slice 2
  ...d.
  P..dd
